/P 103 0 R
/E (The 60-day facility term limits the duration of any single counterparty exposure, allowing the vault to reassess counterparty standing, collateral value, and market conditions at each rollover point rather than committing capital indefinitely. Renewal of any facility is not automatic; each rollover is subject to the same vetting standard applied to a new counterparty relationship.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
