/P 104 0 R
/E (As with any onchain protocol, SGLD, Syncrate Prime, and SYNC contracts carry inherent smart contract risk, undiscovered vulnerabilities that could be exploited despite testing and review. This risk is mitigated, though never eliminated, through standard protective measures: role-based access control, multi-signature administrative permissions, timelocked parameter changes, reentrancy protections, and independent third-party security audits prior to mainnet deployment.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
