492 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (SGLD answers the first half of this premise directly, a token backed unconditionally, 1:1, by verified physical gold, never leased, never placed at risk, redeemable at any time. Syncrate Prime answers the second, an optional, transparent path into gold-backed financing yield, a mechanism institutions have relied on for decades, extended for the first time to individual, on-chain participants, with risk clearly separated and disclosed rather than obscured.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
493 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (This separation, rather than a single blended product promising both safety and yield simultaneously, is the architectural decision underlying everything in this document. It reflects a broader conviction: that trust in a financial instrument is best earned not by minimising the appearance of risk, but by describing it honestly, and by giving holders the ability to choose their own exposure deliberately.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
